/****************************************************************************
 *
 *	 MOTTSK.CPP  --  Motion System Task
 *
 *	 This is the main module for the management of the motion system messages
 *	 generated by the motion system. These functions could not be placed in
 *	 a DLL due to the fact that messages must be received directly.
 *
 *	 Note that all coordinates in this module are in stage encoder counts not
 *	 in microns or mils.
 *
 *	 The client area of the window will update to show the current positon of
 *	 the stage in encoder counts. This updating is facilitated by a timer.
 *	 The most recently received message from the motion system will also be
 *	 displayed.
 *
 *	 It is anticipated that when a release build is done this window will not
 *	 be shown, i.e, this is an anti-bugging facility.
 *
 *	 Author:   Peter F. Spicer
 *
 ****************************************************************************
 */

